1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,096
Human dads would lose this contest.

2
00:00:02,116 --> 00:00:03,200
Badly.

3
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:04,541
Humans have no thick feathers

4
00:00:04,541 --> 00:00:05,594
and no thick fat layer

5
00:00:05,594 --> 00:00:06,274
for this.

6
00:00:06,294 --> 00:00:07,362
In an Antarctic winter

7
00:00:07,362 --> 00:00:09,040
blizzard, exposed skin could

8
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:10,709
get frostbite in just minutes.

9
00:00:11,709 --> 00:00:12,792
And the fast?

10
00:00:12,812 --> 00:00:14,362
Penguins are built for it,

11
00:00:14,382 --> 00:00:15,610
with big fat reserves and

12
00:00:15,610 --> 00:00:16,922
a body that slows down

13
00:00:16,922 --> 00:00:17,996
to save energy.

14
00:00:18,016 --> 00:00:19,369
Humans aren't.

15
00:00:19,389 --> 00:00:20,745
Doctors who care for hunger

16
00:00:20,745 --> 00:00:22,082
strikers report that going

17
00:00:22,082 --> 00:00:23,195
completely without food

18
00:00:23,195 --> 00:00:24,308
becomes life-threatening at

19
00:00:24,308 --> 00:00:25,885
around six to ten weeks.

20
00:00:25,905 --> 00:00:27,676
The penguin plan is four months.

21
00:00:27,696 --> 00:00:28,993
Please, don't try this at home.

22
00:00:29,994 --> 00:00:30,989
Your best move would be

23
00:00:30,989 --> 00:00:31,960
the penguin huddle.

24
00:00:31,980 --> 00:00:33,160
Every body is a little

25
00:00:33,160 --> 00:00:34,312
heater, and a big crowd

26
00:00:34,312 --> 00:00:35,462
keeps each other warm.

27
00:00:35,482 --> 00:00:36,503
A few thousand dads in

28
00:00:36,503 --> 00:00:37,204
a huddle?

29
00:00:37,224 --> 00:00:38,741
That's a lot of warm dads.

30
00:00:38,761 --> 00:00:40,629
And a lot of dad jokes.

31
00:00:40,649 --> 00:00:42,275
Subscribe for more what ifs!
